\description{
An \strong{interval selection} is filled by dragging a brush over the plot. The
brushed pixel range is converted to a \emph{data-value} range on each of the
\code{encodings} (through the panel's scale), and every element whose data values
fall inside that range is a member. \code{\link[=condition]{condition()}} and \code{\link[=filter_by]{filter_by()}} react to it
